IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble applied to every question below: all conditions for
-- the policy to apply that are unrelated to the specific question are
-- set so that they are satisfied, and no exclusion unrelated to the
-- question is triggered. The agreement is signed and the premium paid on
-- time (per policy.l4's header). All dates/times other than age are
-- given relative to the policy's effective date, in months, matching the
-- wording of each question.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a
-- firefighter. Burns are an accidental injury; the injury arises out of
-- firefighting service (Section 3.1(3)), so it is excluded regardless of
-- the (here all satisfied) unrelated conditions.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Accidental Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS TRUE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 1
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q1

-- Q2: 78 years old at the time of hospitalization. 78 is below the
-- Section 3.1(5) threshold of 80, so the age exclusion does not apply.
-- No cause implicating any other exclusion is given, so a generic
-- sickness is assumed.
q2 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS Sickness
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 78
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 1
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q2

-- Q3: hospitalized for pneumonia 5 months after the effective date, age
-- 65 at hospitalization. Pneumonia is a sickness; age is well under 80;
-- 5 months is well within both the wellness-visit window and the
-- 12-month policy term.
q3 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS Sickness
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 65
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 5
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 1
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q3

-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad, having given
-- confirmation of the wellness visit 8 months after the effective date.
-- A fall is an accidental injury. Confirmation at month 8 is later than
-- Section 1.3's 7-month deadline, and "I had given confirmation ...
-- [and] was hospitalized" places the hospitalization after that
-- confirmation, i.e. after month 7, so the wellness-visit condition is
-- neither satisfied in time nor still pending -- the policy is deemed
-- canceled under Section 1.2. Separately, "traveling abroad" is read as
-- the hospitalization itself (not merely the fall) occurring outside the
-- United States, which independently fails Section 2.2's territorial
-- condition on the benefit.
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Accidental Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 9
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 8
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS FALSE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q4

-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for my friends;
-- no fraud or misrepresentation was committed. Punching oneself in the
-- face on purpose is a deliberate act, not an accident, so the resulting
-- injury is an intentionally self-inflicted injury rather than a
-- "sickness or accidental Injury" within Section 2.1's own definition of
-- what is insured -- independent of the (here true) absence of fraud,
-- which goes to Section 1.2 cancelation, not to Section 2.1's threshold
-- definition.
q5 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Intentional Self-Inflicted Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 1
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q5

-- Q6: hospitalized due to an injury sustained while skydiving, age 79 at
-- hospitalization, proof of the wellness visit provided 6.5 months after
-- the effective date. The skydiving exclusion (Section 3.1(1)) applies
-- regardless of age (79 is under the 80 threshold) or the wellness-visit
-- timing (6.5 months is within the 7-month deadline).
q6 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Accidental Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS TRUE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 79
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 6.5
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q6

-- Q7: hospitalized for a heart attack, wellness-visit proof submitted 2
-- months after the effective date, age 75 at hospitalization. A heart
-- attack is a sickness; age is under 80; 2 months is well within the
-- wellness-visit deadlines.
q7 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS Sickness
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 75
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 2
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q7

-- Q8: hospitalized after being injured in a military training exercise;
-- the hospitalization occurred within the policy term; no fraud was
-- committed. The injury arises out of military service (Section
-- 3.1(2)), so it is excluded regardless of the (here satisfied) policy
-- term and fraud conditions.
q8 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Accidental Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS TRUE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 6
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 1
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q8

-- Q9: hospitalized due to my son biting me in the ankle, proof of the
-- wellness visit provided 6 months after the effective date, and I was
-- serving as a police officer at the time of hospitalization. A bite
-- from one's own child is an accidental injury unconnected to police
-- service: Section 3.1(4) excludes events "arising directly or
-- indirectly out of" service in the police, not merely being a police
-- officer at the time of an unrelated domestic accident, so the
-- exclusion does not apply here. 6 months is within the wellness-visit
-- deadlines.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `cause of hospitalization`                                    IS `Accidental Injury`
    `arising out of skydiving`                                    IS FALSE
    `arising out of military service`                             IS FALSE
    `arising out of firefighting service`                         IS FALSE
    `arising out of police service`                               IS FALSE
    `age at hospitalization`                                      IS 40
    `hospitalization months since the effective date`             IS 1
    `wellness visit months since the effective date`              IS 1
    `wellness visit confirmation months since the effective date` IS 6
    `fraud or misrepresentation or material withholding`          IS FALSE
    `confinement in a hospital in the United States`               IS TRUE
    `days of continuous confinement`                              IS 3
#EVAL `covered` q9
